{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269yPZc8X85k1792826688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>衞生署HIV測試服務網站電郵戶口懷疑被不正當使用，即日起暫停運作。</p><p></p><p>衞生署指，昨晚發現有人利用該電郵戶口，冒充衞生署向市民發出電郵或短訊，聲稱收件人有感染愛滋病病毒的風險，須盡快求醫和接受檢測。</p><p></p><p>署方指，已即時和外判服務供應商全面檢查網絡系統，正嚴肅調查事件，暫時沒有發現資料遺失或外洩。網站服務暫停期間，市民可致電愛滋熱線預約接受免費、不記名測試。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:22:11.170236+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:13.915652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:13.915652+00:00","content_hash":"a96cd51eb0b72104c77852bc31104e2e717cec050a73179d2dadc10e81f122e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}